{"html_text": {"an4.67:0.1": "<article id='an4.67'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "an4.67:0.2": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "an4.67:0.3": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "an4.67:1.1": "<p>{}</p>", "an4.67:1.2": "<p>{}", "an4.67:1.3": "{}", "an4.67:1.4": "{}</p>", "an4.67:2.1": "<p>{}", "an4.67:2.2": "{}</p>", "an4.67:3.1": "<p>{}", "an4.67:3.2": "{}", "an4.67:3.3": "{}", "an4.67:3.4": "{}</p>", "an4.67:4.1": "<p>{}</p>", "an4.67:5.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "an4.67:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "an4.67:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "an4.67:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "an4.67:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "an4.67:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:10.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "an4.67:10.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "an4.67:10.7": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"an4.67:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.67 ", "an4.67:0.2": "7. Pattakammavagga ", "an4.67:0.3": "Ahirājasutta ", "an4.67:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ", "an4.67:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena sāvatthiyaṁ aññataro bhikkhu ahinā daṭṭho kālaṅkato hoti. ", "an4.67:1.3": "Atha kho sambahulā bhikkhū yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinnā kho te bhikkhū bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ: ", "an4.67:1.4": "“idha, bhante, sāvatthiyaṁ aññataro bhikkhu ahinā daṭṭho kālaṅkato”ti. ", "an4.67:2.1": "“Na hi nūna so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cattāri ahirājakulāni mettena cittena phari. ", "an4.67:2.2": "Sace hi so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cattāri ahirājakulāni mettena cittena phareyya, na hi so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu ahinā daṭṭho kālaṁ kareyya. ", "an4.67:3.1": "Katamāni cattāri? ", "an4.67:3.2": "Virūpakkhaṁ ahirājakulaṁ, erāpathaṁ ahirājakulaṁ, chabyāputtaṁ ahirājakulaṁ, kaṇhāgotamakaṁ ahirājakulaṁ. ", "an4.67:3.3": "Na hi nūna so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu imāni cattāri ahirājakulāni mettena cittena phari. ", "an4.67:3.4": "Sace hi so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu imāni cattāri ahirājakulāni mettena cittena phareyya, na hi so, bhikkhave, bhikkhu ahinā daṭṭho kālaṁ kareyya. ", "an4.67:4.1": "Anujānāmi, bhikkhave, imāni cattāri ahirājakulāni mettena cittena pharituṁ attaguttiyā attarakkhāya attaparittāyāti. ", "an4.67:5.1": "Virūpakkhehi me mettaṁ, ", "an4.67:5.2": "Mettaṁ erāpathehi me; ", "an4.67:5.3": "Chabyāputtehi me mettaṁ, ", "an4.67:5.4": "Mettaṁ kaṇhāgotamakehi ca. ", "an4.67:6.1": "Apādakehi me mettaṁ, ", "an4.67:6.2": "mettaṁ dvipādakehi me; ", "an4.67:6.3": "Catuppadehi me mettaṁ, ", "an4.67:6.4": "mettaṁ bahuppadehi me. ", "an4.67:7.1": "Mā maṁ apādako hiṁsi, ", "an4.67:7.2": "mā maṁ hiṁsi dvipādako; ", "an4.67:7.3": "Mā maṁ catuppado hiṁsi, ", "an4.67:7.4": "mā maṁ hiṁsi bahuppado. ", "an4.67:8.1": "Sabbe sattā sabbe pāṇā, ", "an4.67:8.2": "sabbe bhūtā ca kevalā; ", "an4.67:8.3": "Sabbe bhadrāni passantu, ", "an4.67:8.4": "mā kañci pāpamāgamā. ", "an4.67:9.1": "Appamāṇo buddho, ", "an4.67:9.2": "Appamāṇo dhammo; ", "an4.67:9.3": "Appamāṇo saṅgho, ", "an4.67:9.4": "Pamāṇavantāni sarīsapāni. ", "an4.67:10.1": "Ahivicchikā satapadī, ", "an4.67:10.2": "Uṇṇanābhī sarabū mūsikā; ", "an4.67:10.3": "Katā me rakkhā katā me parittā, ", "an4.67:10.4": "Paṭikkamantu bhūtāni; ", "an4.67:10.5": "Sohaṁ namo bhagavato, ", "an4.67:10.6": "Namo sattannaṁ sammāsambuddhānan”ti. ", "an4.67:10.7": "Sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"an4.67:0.1": "", "an4.67:0.2": "", "an4.67:0.3": "Ahirājasutta → ahi (metta) suttaṁ (bj) ", "an4.67:1.1": "", "an4.67:1.2": "", "an4.67:1.3": "", "an4.67:1.4": "", "an4.67:2.1": "Na hi nūna → nahanūna (bj, cck, sya1ed, km, pts1ed); naha nūna (sya2ed) ", "an4.67:2.2": "", "an4.67:3.1": "", "an4.67:3.2": "", "an4.67:3.3": "", "an4.67:3.4": "", "an4.67:4.1": "", "an4.67:5.1": "", "an4.67:5.2": "", "an4.67:5.3": "", "an4.67:5.4": "", "an4.67:6.1": "", "an4.67:6.2": "dvipādakehi → dipādakehi (bj, sya-all, km, pts1ed) ", "an4.67:6.3": "", "an4.67:6.4": "", "an4.67:7.1": "", "an4.67:7.2": "dvipādako → dipādako (bj, sya-all, km, pts1ed) ", "an4.67:7.3": "", "an4.67:7.4": "", "an4.67:8.1": "", "an4.67:8.2": "", "an4.67:8.3": "", "an4.67:8.4": "kañci → kiñci (sya-all, km, mr) ", "an4.67:9.1": "", "an4.67:9.2": "", "an4.67:9.3": "", "an4.67:9.4": "sarīsapāni → siriṁsapāni (bj, sya-all, km, pts1ed) ", "an4.67:10.1": "", "an4.67:10.2": "", "an4.67:10.3": "rakkhā katā me parittā → kataṁ me parittaṁ (?) ", "an4.67:10.4": "", "an4.67:10.5": "", "an4.67:10.6": "", "an4.67:10.7": ""}, "reference_text": {"an4.67:0.1": "", "an4.67:0.2": "", "an4.67:0.3": "", "an4.67:1.1": "bj19.136, csp1ed15.384, csp2ed15.384, dr21.100, ms15A4_489, msdiv67, sya21.94, vri36.84", "an4.67:1.2": "", "an4.67:1.3": "", "an4.67:1.4": "", "an4.67:2.1": "cck21.95, ms15A4_490", "an4.67:2.2": "", "an4.67:3.1": "ms15A4_491", "an4.67:3.2": "", "an4.67:3.3": "", "an4.67:3.4": "", "an4.67:4.1": "ms15A4_492, ndp17.77", "an4.67:5.1": "ms15A4_493", "an4.